From: Project Luma
Subject: [PATCH] Shell: preserve symbolic strokes and native outer geometry

Use supported symbolic paint classes in St without changing legacy filled
icons. Align clocks by Pango baseline, bound native Quick Options lists and
reserve their scrollbar gutter. Shelf keeps edge padding independently of
tiling; existing Mutter work-area semantics preserve true fullscreen.

